		{"id":"title-note","type":"text","text":"# 99 End-to-End Flowchart\n\nSpatial arrangement of the anchors in `99 End-to-End Timeline Flowchart.md` — read that file for the prose behind any step, `00 Roadmap.md` for the doc set's conventions. Each box embeds one `^prefix-N` block; arrows show execution order within a section. The five \"parallel loop\" columns (Movement, Equip, Enemy, Combat, Camera) run concurrently once a player is in-world, not in the sequence drawn top-to-bottom inside each column. \"07 Meanwhile, independently\" (admin) runs out-of-band at any time from server boot onward, not gated on any player session step.","x":0,"y":-260,"width":1840,"height":220},
